# GRACE Approvals Log
# Format: GRACE_APPROVAL v2 (approvals.log-only policy)
#
# Rules:
# - Append-only: add new approvals at the end.
# - Each <GRACE_APPROVAL ref="..."/> MUST match the target <GRACE_HANDOFF id="..."> string exactly (including any -suffix).
# - approved MUST be ISO-8601 with timezone offset.
#
# Example (commented):
# <GRACE_APPROVAL
#   ref="Handoff-20251230-01[-suffix]"
#   status="APPROVED"
#   approved="2025-12-30T10:00:00+00:00"
#   approver="Human"
# />

